# Line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout, on Windows and macOS alike (both edit the same files;
# MSVC, PowerShell, Inno Setup and rc.exe all read LF). Git decides what is text; the binary types are named below.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pfx binary
*.p12 binary
